      "prevention": "Use current age-, risk-, travel-, and outbreak-based MenACWY and MenB vaccination guidance; vaccinate people with asplenia, complement deficiency, or complement-inhibitor exposure as indicated. Identify eligible close contacts promptly and give prophylaxis as soon as possible, ideally within 24 hours of recognizing the index case, while maintaining respiratory hygiene and outbreak reporting.",
