      "prevention": "There is no general screening or prevention program. Reduce avoidable treatment harm through vaccination and infection planning before immunosuppression when feasible, hepatitis B management, fertility counseling, cardiac-risk control, and surveillance appropriate to the treatment received. HIV control and careful monitoring after transplantation reduce some lymphoma risk contexts.",
