      "differential": "Differentiate Alport syndrome from IgA nephropathy, other COL4-related thin-basement-membrane phenotypes, C3 glomerulopathy, MYH9-related disease, branchio-oto-renal disorders, and other inherited causes of hearing loss with kidney disease. Do not use benign familial hematuria as a reassuring endpoint without appropriate COL4 evaluation.",
