      "differential": "Differentiate PCD from cystic fibrosis, immune deficiency, asthma, aspiration, chronic rhinosinusitis, recurrent viral infection, and other causes of non-CF bronchiectasis. Cough variability, allergy, or an asthma diagnosis can coexist but should not erase a lifelong daily wet-cough phenotype.",
